  "scope_notes": "Touches the script interpreter, block and mempool validation logic, and the experimental libbitcoinkernel C API.",
  "changed_since_previous": "Added commit ffc8cf187b to prevent `btck_script_pubkey_verify()` from copying caller-supplied `PrecomputedTransactionData` on each call.",
  "card": "This PR eliminates default construction and public `Init()` from `PrecomputedTransactionData`, making all instances immutably tied to a single transaction at creation. Validation now uses `std::optional` to lazily construct txdata only upon script cache misses, and block connection avoids allocating txdata containers when assumevalid bypasses script checks. It also fixes an unintended copy of precomputed txdata in the experimental kernel C verification API, supported by a compiler reproducer. No open dependencies are declared.",
